(" "), not single quotes 
Datatypes:
string: eg "srikar"
Number: integer/floating-point eg: 27, 2.12
boolea: true or false without quotes
array: an ordered list of values enclosed in square brackets [] eg [1,2,3]
object: A nested collection of key-value pairs enclosed in curly braces {}
null: an empty or null value represented by null
